{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07493","headline":"齐一和尚影堂 · 刘长卿","name":"齐一和尚影堂","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一公住世忘世纷，暂来复去谁能分。\n身寄虚空如过客，心将生灭是浮云。\n萧散浮云往不还，凄凉遗教殁仍传。\n旧地愁看双树在，空堂只是一灯悬。\n一灯长照恒河沙，双树犹落诸天花。\n天花寂寂香深殿，苔藓苍苍閟虚院。\n昔余精念访禅扉，常接微言清道机。\n今来寂寞无所得，唯共门人泪满衣。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘长卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07493.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07493","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}